Package: ssh-tailscale-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk, openssh-client
Recommends: openssh-server, policykit-1 | polkitd, ufw
Maintainer: itsnavin <itsnavin@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/itsnavin/ssh-tailscale-manager
Description: Manage OpenSSH server, SSH keys and Tailscale from one window
 A small desktop app: start/stop the SSH server, generate SSH key pairs,
 copy keys to another host, manage authorized_keys, and bring Tailscale
 up or down. Publisher: itsnavin.
